.SH NAME
\&ag\-cli\-run\-artifact\-view \- View artifact metadata without downloading the archive
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\&ag\-cli run artifact view [<owner>/<repo>] <artifact\-id> [flags]
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
\&Display AtomGit Actions artifact metadata.
.PP
